      <title>AI Agent 生产成功率仅 24%：提示词失效后数据库如何接管上下文</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260903/AI-Agent-%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E7%8E%87%E4%BB%85-24%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E8%AF%8D%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E5%90%8E%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%8E%A5%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87/</link>
